":{"value":"Episodio 25","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After a sleepless night, the first match of the tournament has arrived. But Kuzu High isn’t the only team pinning their dreams on this game.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-04-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fl9hInb2YX8KTaKAk95EsC9ATVC.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fl9hInb2YX8KTaKAk95EsC9ATVC.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92892/season/1/episode/25"},{"id":"2209391","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":26,"title":{"value":"Episodio 26","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Hobble a key player, and the entire team will fall apart. Chiaki learns this lesson the hard way when the players of Shinjo High render his passing abilities obsolete.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-04-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/etovzWSWaxEf0qkAHyYFGCgEKIN.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/etovzWSWaxEf0qkAHyYFGCgEKIN.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92892/season/1/episode/26"},{"id":"2227038","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":27,"title":{"value":"Episodio 27","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kuzu’s early lead makes no difference to Shinjo High, who quickly takes control of the game. Subbed in as pointguard, can Sora turn the tide back in his team’s favor?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-04-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kUqMwhQ7t7GOJfy9xjoItgQXr6H.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kUqMwhQ7t7GOJfy9xjoItgQXr6H.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92892/season/1/episode/27"},{"id":"2230509","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":28,"title":{"value":"Episodio 28","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As pressure builds and halftime approaches, Chiaki makes a decision that could shake the entire team. Will he leave Kuzu high and dry or rally in time for the second half?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-04-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xv7A9BLGt48zwH8N0OpBLYqAftD.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xv7A9BLGt48zwH8N0OpBLYqAftD.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92892/season/1/episode/28"},{"id":"2230510","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":29,"title":{"value":"Episodio 29","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As Kuzu dominates the court, the prospect of winning fades for Shinjo High — but help is on the way from the team’s most unlikely player.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-04-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nPfLrSUKv21nZrLRmgtoG6MMVPa.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nPfLrSUKv21nZrLRmgtoG6MMVPa.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92892/season/1/episode/29"},{"id":"2259431","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":30,"title":{"value":"Episodio 30","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Despite his terrible knee injury, Kojima’s skill are formidable, but he isn’t the only member of Shinjo High that Kuzu should keep on their radar…","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-05-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xUGelx3ITgQwV5KGGjze2zmAcPJ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xUGelx3ITgQwV5KGGjze2zmAcPJ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92892/season/1/episode/30"},{"id":"2259432","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":31,"title":{"value":"Episodio 31","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As the end of the game draws near, the players of Kuzu High push themselves to the limit. Only one thing’s for certain: Stamina will decide their fate.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-05-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lQQqtVUIft7Q5CqXd5q6mNY9bqJ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lQQqtVUIft7Q5CqXd5q6mNY9bqJ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92892/season/1/episode/31"},{"id":"2271798","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":32,"title":{"value":"Episodio 32","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With only seconds on the clock, the pressure of defending the lead falls squarely on Kuzu High. But winning the match isn’t the only thing Sora needs to worry about…","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-05-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/t2lHHLQOjbmCB8ZmG8m1fejRoup.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t2lHHLQOjbmCB8ZmG8m1fejRoup.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92892/season/1/episode/32"},{"id":"2278633","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":33,"title":{"value":"Episodio 33","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Reunited at long last, Sora and his mother have a lot to talk about — and time is of the essence. Elsewhere, Sora’s teammates deal with the aftermath of their recent match.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-05-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gEk8s1qwA318x9ukTZX8ou8ZJSN.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gEk8s1qwA318x9ukTZX8ou8ZJSN.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92892/season/1/episode/33"},{"id":"2295030","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":34,"title":{"value":"Episodio 34","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Sora is nowhere to be found, and in his absence, the basketball team must pick up the pieces. Whether they will succeed depends on the fire burning in their hearts.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-06-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iSsbySO0rlXFJbgmO6IL85lHpZo.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iSsbySO0rlXFJbgmO6IL85lHpZo.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92892/season/1/episode/34"},{"id":"2295125","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":35,"title":{"value":"Episodio 35","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A new challenger with mysterious motivations approaches Tobi for a game of one-on-one. Meanwhile, Sora returns, but the basketball team isn’t the same club he left behind.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-06-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hngSBIlLxlckNmV1OT2HnWiqJyY.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hngSBIlLxlckNmV1OT2HnWiqJyY.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92892/season/1/episode/35"},{"id":"2312174","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":36,"title":{"value":"Episodio 36","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The team must find a new advisor, so they take matters into their own hands — but will Satsuki be willing to return to the basketball club? Better yet, will Momoharu?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-06-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yxGyOmSUxt6Up37FPhzvfbJqC0O.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yxGyOmSUxt6Up37FPhzvfbJqC0O.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92892/season/1/episode/36"},{"id":"2312524","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":37,"title":{"value":"Episodio 37","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"It may be raining, but nothing can douse Sora and his teammates’ fiery passion for basketball. Proving that passion to the administration, however, is another matter entirely.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-07-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gTl1lBJUzopo8oku1wyJ0dXbSZf.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gTl1lBJUzopo8oku1wyJ0dXbSZf.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92892/season/1/episode/37"},{"id":"2341995","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":38,"title":{"value":"Episodio 38","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Restless and unfocused, Madoka takes the night off to hang out with friends. But fun turns to fear when Madoka realizes she’s lost something important in the pouring rain…","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-07-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dz9GcbnvEUGVBZEFA6kHUbFNYoM.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dz9GcbnvEUGVBZEFA6kHUbFNYoM.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92892/season/1/episode/38"},{"id":"2341996","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":39,"title":{"value":"Episodio 39","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Chiba is determined to take Maru High to the top! And with only one more chance to reach the inter-high, they’ll have to pull out all the stops to beat Yokohama Taiei.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-07-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rmfc9pQM3opI8L9JrEPz20p6n4g.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rmfc9pQM3opI8L9JrEPz20p6n4g.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92892/season/1/episode/39"},{"id":"2352288","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":40,"title":{"value":"Episodio 40","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Yokohama Taiei is a force to be reckoned with, but not everyone is suited for a spot on this infamous team. Elsewhere, Sora seeks out a previous opponent for guidance.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-07-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gaimNppDDqO2WX6izHAIulI6hFS.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gaimNppDDqO2WX6izHAIulI6hFS.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92892/season/1/episode/40"},{"id":"2363151","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":41,"title":{"value":"Episodio 41","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The day of the match against Yokohama Taiei descends along with a wave of unprecedented heat… and Tobi is nowhere to be found.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-07-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cWRNPUzvZIuuXket4vvR3c1k1Pw.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cWRNPUzvZIuuXket4vvR3c1k1Pw.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92892/season/1/episode/41"},{"id":"2363152","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":42,"title":{"value":"Episodio 42","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After a rocky start, Kuzu plays surprisingly well again Yokohama Taiei — but when a new player enters the game, the tide abruptly turns.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-08-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nNCZCMMJayxChqThgZEbVQ4yIWO.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nNCZCMMJayxChqThgZEbVQ4yIWO.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92892/season/1/episode/42"},{"id":"2363153","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":43,"title":{"value":"Episodio 43","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"At rock bottom, the only way to go is up. Tobi knows this all too well, and he’s determined to take Kuzu High all the way to the top! But first they need to take Taiei down…","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-08-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iqZzoE87qnnoNfw7IqSnQAyAFx7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iqZzoE87qnnoNfw7IqSnQAyAFx7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92892/season/1/episode/43"},{"id":"2363154","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":44,"title":{"value":"Episodio 44","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"What’s a pint-sized point guard to do when the opposition shuts down every play? Advice on the matter comes from an unexpected source, but it may do more harm than good.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-08-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cr84XwgZTAFU8xeEwSI2Oe9Z280.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cr84XwgZTAFU8xeEwSI2Oe9Z280.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92892/season/1/episode/44"},{"id":"2363156","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":45,"title":{"value":"Episodio 45","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Tobi and Sora have something in common: rivalries with other players. Too bad Tobi’s rivalry seems so one-sided… for now, at least.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-08-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gWROZIVhwtt6KNZdNvWPuXVNh6W.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gWROZIVhwtt6KNZdNvWPuXVNh6W.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92892/season/1/episode/45"},{"id":"2363157","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":46,"title":{"value":"Episodio 46","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Once they find the spark that sets them alight, Kuzu High will not be stopped. The spark that sets Sora ablaze? Another player who will bring out his full potential.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-09-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qT1qouVhDyzNc42a9vtaVvZrdGU.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qT1qouVhDyzNc42a9vtaVvZrdGU.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92892/season/1/episode/46"},{"id":"2363158","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":47,"title":{"value":"Episodio 47","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Sora gets a run for his money when a pokerfaced new player leaps onto the court — and into the role of the opposition’s point guard.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-09-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nLHDNDlv37f6Y8SwmNkgtkJRAYY.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nLHDNDlv37f6Y8SwmNkgtkJRAYY.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92892/season/1/episode/47"},{"id":"2363159","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":48,"title":{"value":"Episodio 48","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Some players run toward the finish line; others stop or slow down along the way. With Chiaki’s help, Tobi intends to sprint straight to winning against Yokohama Taiei!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-09-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nAyZJm73lQeHCXVfRpnC3GUhgmX.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nAyZJm73lQeHCXVfRpnC3GUhgmX.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92892/season/1/episode/48"},{"id":"2363160","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":49,"title":{"value":"Episodio 49","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"It’s the final period of their match against Yokohama, and the fate of the Kuzu High basketball team hangs entirely upon their performance in the last few seconds of the game.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-09-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qC1NGhRTur0nMXRGRv6fY4BxXm